>> title: Brown Butter Brownies
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: chocolate, brown butter, dessert, oven
>> servings: 9
>> time: 50 min

Line an #8x8-in pan{} with parchment.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Brown @unsalted butter{8%Tbs}(115 g) in a #saucepan{} until it smells nutty.

Melt @bittersweet chocolate{6%oz}(170 g; chopped) into @&(~1)brown butter{}.

Whisk @&(~1)chocolate mixture{} with @granulated sugar{3/4%cup}(150 g), @light brown sugar{1/4%cup}(50 g), and @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL).

Beat @&(~1)mixture{} with @eggs{2%large}(100 g).

Fold in @all-purpose flour{3/4%cup}(95 g), @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g) to @&(~1)batter{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{30%min}.
